      "writtenOn": "2023-07-31T15:42:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My feedback is as follows:\n- I\u0027m surprised that there is a need to modify `cmd_size` from the host driver. Does this perhaps mean that this is part of an effort to add support for a UFS host controller that is not fully conforming with the UFSHCI specification?\n- Apparently commit f2e2fe3dec7f (\"scsi: ufs: Declare SCSI host template const\") has not yet been backported to the android14-6.1 kernel. Anyway, ufshcd_driver_template should not be modified.",
      "revId": "e7cefed58a93ee75b1e705e8a3554a833e71c1af",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "86afb47d_ba087f62",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
