      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1879222
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-08T07:21:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, We just want to add OEM padding to struct request. To avoid violating KMI, we choose to modify \u0027cmd_size\u0027 instead. \nIf the \u0027ufshcd_driver_template\u0027 structure becomes const, then this hook will become invalid. I will try to find another way.",
      "parentUuid": "c8082e32_2d2a7b33",
      "revId": "e7cefed58a93ee75b1e705e8a3554a833e71c1af",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
